  m_text: 'Press W, A, S, D to move.

    Press the left click on your mouse to pickup
    the item.

    Press the right click on your mouse to use the selected item.

    Press
    1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, or scroll to select an item.

    Press Q to drop the selected
    item.

    Press M to toggle the minimap.

    Press ESCAPE to pause the game.'
